         measured: a_i = d_i phi: True; K = 0; EH identity True
    leading O(eps^2) coefficient of the exact static density = the stated braces: True
    psi equation solved by Psi = Phi: True;  (reduced action at alpha_c = 0) - (ACTION.md's I_NR) = 0
    Euler-Lagrange residuals vs the stated equations (polynomial kernel): Phi-eq 0, u-eq 0
    linear response q' = C: Phi / Phi_N = 2*(-C - 1)/(C*alpha_c + alpha_c - 2)  (L340's static_psi (1+C)/(1 - alpha_c (1+C)/2): True)
